  "id": "apple-date-and-tamarind-chutney",
  "name": "Apple, Date and Tamarind Chutney",
  "subtitle": "Sweet-tart fruit chutney with dates and tamarind",
  "description": "A richly spiced-style chutney combining apples, dates, tamarind, and cider vinegar for a balanced sweet and tangy condiment.",
  "meal_type": "other",
  "yield": {
